repository, for example under handoff/, are covered in the same way.

- uACPI: arch/x86_64/uacpi/
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022-2026 Daniil Tatianin (see uacpi/LICENSE).
- Lua 5.4.7: userland/vendor/lua-5.4.7/
  MIT License, Copyright (C) 1994-2024 Lua.org, PUC-Rio.
- kilo: userland/vendor/kilo.c
  BSD 2-Clause License, Copyright (C) 2016 Salvatore Sanfilippo.
- Picolibc: downloaded at build time by userland/build.py
  BSD-style licenses, see userland/licenses/Picolibc.txt.
- Aileron Regular font: arch/x86_64/fonts/Aileron-Regular.ttf, and the
  bitmap font generated from it in kernel/uifont.h
  CC0 1.0 (public domain), by Sora Sagano.
- Realtek network firmware: arch/x86_64/firmware/rtl_nic/
  Realtek redistribution license, see arch/x86_64/firmware/LICENSE.r8169.
- Wayland protocol definitions: arch/x86_64/protocols/*.xml
  MIT-style licenses stated in each file.
- TLS root certificates in kernel/roots.h
  Generated from certifi (Mozilla CA certificate data, MPL-2.0).
- Software that NexusOS downloads during installation (for example Debian
  packages, Google Chrome, Firefox, LibreOffice, VS Code and Wine, pinned in
  the *-lock.json files) is not part of this repository. It stays under its
  own licenses.
